  "The memory rail is measured at the regulator INPUT (~5.04 V) and is NOT rescaled to 1.8 V. It is an upper bound on DRAM power; quote its above-idle delta next to the absolute value, and never call it 'DRAM power' without those words (protocol \u00a74).",
